        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774180/extras/ac38deaa074cd4ca1539369726fd5a02.avif?t=1772360944\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find cute cats in the quiet and cozy old city block.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find them? Meow Meow...Kittens are calling you！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774180/extras/998ec2b0fe778fa3d0ee375cfe620f90.avif?t=1772360944\" width=548 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Hand drawn cartoon minimalist style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· More than 900 cats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· More than 300 special items <br>· Find cats in colorful world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Explore the entire old city block</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Includes 4 richly detailed colorful scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Some interesting scene interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Sounds of cats can help you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Drag and zoom the screen view </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Relax and find all the cats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774180/extras/4a81a4fa106c2a40a582b326f86ec1d8.avif?t=1772360944\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p>",
